#: setup.php
msgid "This is only required if your Cacti System's Flowview Database connection is not already using a MaxScale enabled Read-Write Split port."
msgstr "Detta krävs bara om Cacti-systemets FlowView-databasanslutning inte redan använder en MaxScale-aktiverad Read-Write-Split-port."

#: setup.php
